# GitHub's language bar counts only `programming`/`markup` languages by
# default — YAML is classified `data` and is excluded, so this repository's
# ~230KB of Taskfile YAML counted for nothing next to the one small
# release.config.cjs, and the bar showed 100% JavaScript. Forcing YAML in
# overrides that default without touching what release.config.cjs itself is.
*.yaml linguist-language=YAML
*.yml linguist-language=YAML
